Possible improvements:
- Proged vs dascoli:
    - d_max ... max degree 6, i.e. till a_n[-6].
    - o_max ... max operators: <--> n of nodes. Maybe max depth < 10 or < 5. limit recursion by probability.
    - l_min, l_max ... n_pred random from 5 to 30.
    - p_const, p_index, p_var ... change to 1/3 each. Currently: 1/2 vs 1/2*1/3=1/6 vs 1/2* 2/3 = 1/3.
    - for each equation only one initials (instead of 10).
  - Grammar like: S -> O(perator) 0.5 | L(eaf) 0.5  oz. to je glavna regulacija
                  L -> C 1/3 | n 1/3 | V 1/3
                  V -> a_n[-1] 0.05 | a_n[-2] 0.09 | a_n[-3] 0.10 | a_n[-4] 0.09 | a_n[-5] 0.08 
                  O -> S + S 0.2 | S - S 0.2 | S * F 0.2 | S // F 0.2 | S % F 0.2 | ( S ) 0.2 | abs( S ) 0.2 | itd. ...
- Linear grammar for linrec and dascoli to beat:
  - Grammar like: S -> O(perator) 0.5 | L 0.5  oz. to je glavna regulacija
                  L -> C 1/3 | n 1/3 | V 1/3
                  V -> a_n[-1] 0.05 | a_n[-2] 0.09 | a_n[-3] 0.10 | a_n[-4] 0.09 | a_n[-5] 0.08 | a_n[-25]? 0.08
                  O -> S + S 1 


